{
  "id": "RAW_094085293e",
  "title": "OpenAI 推出面向小企业的 ChatGPT 计划",
  "url": "https://openai.com/index/introducing-chatgpt-small-business-program",
  "date": "2026-07-22 01:00:00",
  "author": "OpenAI",
  "siteName": "OpenAI News",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"w-full\">\n   <div class=\"relative w-full\" style=\"--hero-aspect-ratio:16/9;--hero-aspect-ratio-mobile:3/4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px]\">\n     <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-span-8 toc-visible:@md:col-start-1\">\n      <div class=\"relative flex flex-col items-center text-center\">\n       <div class=\"mb-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center\">\n        <p class=\"text-meta text-primary-100\">\n         <br>\n        </p>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"contents\">\n   <div class=\"w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px]\">\n    <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 max-w-none not-first:mt-6\">\n     <p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0\"><span>Small businesses start with people who are exceptional at what they do—a craft, a trade, an idea they believe in. But building a business demands far more than expertise alone. With a lean team, limited time, and few resources, every owner is expected to be the marketer, accountant, salesperson, operator, and strategist all-in-one. We believe AI can change that by being a force multiplier that extends individual expertise, increases capacity, and gives everyone access to world class tools they need to achieve their greatest ambitions.</span></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 max-w-none not-first:mt-6\">\n     <p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0\"><span>We’re announcing the launch of our </span><a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 relative underline-offset-[0.25rem] decoration-1 underline\" href=\"https://openai.com/business/why-openai/small-business/\"><span>ChatGPT for small businesses program</span></a><span>, an initiative to help small businesses be more productive and scale their businesses with ChatGPT. The ChatGPT for small businesses program includes:</span></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 max-w-none not-first:mt-6\">\n     <ul class=\"mb-8 marker:text-inherit last:mb-0 in-[:where(ul,ol)]:mt-2 list-disc in-[:where(ul,ol)]:list-[circle] mx-3 ps-4\">\n      <li class=\"mb-2\"><a href=\"https://webinar.openai.com/small-business/\" class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 relative underline-offset-[0.25rem] decoration-1 underline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b><span>Hands on virtual training:</span></b>⁠<span class=\"sr-only\">(opens in a new window)</span></a><span> Product-specific webinars that show how small businesses can use ChatGPT Work in their day-to-day. Attendees will see demos with specific small business use cases, get prompts to try, and learn automations and workflows across accounting, marketing, ecommerce, and more. We will also feature partner webinars and Q&amp;As to have clear takeaways that apply immediately to your business.</span></li>\n      <li class=\"mb-2\"><a href=\"https://academy.openai.com/home/clubs/small-business-ipf4m/events\" class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 relative underline-offset-[0.25rem] decoration-1 underline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b><span>In-person small business AI academies</span></b>⁠<span class=\"sr-only\">(opens in a new window)</span></a><span>: Meet in person across the US with our OpenAI Academy team. These events bring together local business owners for guided instruction, hands-on exercises, and support from fellow business owners. At our </span><a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 relative underline-offset-[0.25rem] decoration-1 underline\" href=\"https://openai.com/index/small-business-ai-jam/\"><span>Small Business AI Jams</span></a><span> last year, 78% of participants built a functional AI workflow in a single day, and 42% saved more than five hours a week with the help of AI, and we’re excited to recreate this success this year.</span></li>\n      <li class=\"mb-2\"><b><span>New guides to get started:</span></b><span> New content from </span><a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 relative underline-offset-[0.25rem] decoration-1 underline\" href=\"https://openai.com/index/small-business-stories/\"><span>customer stories</span></a><span>, to interactive guides you can upload right into ChatGPT Work to start your workflow, to short-form videos you can consume on your own time. These resources have specific prompts and examples of how business owners can get started with ChatGPT Work in minutes.</span></li>\n      <li class=\"mb-2\"><b><span>New agents and partners built for small business:</span></b><span> </span><span>Explore plugins, skills, and special offers from a curated list of partners most useful to small businesses, including Dropbox, Shopify, Intuit, Slack, Atlassian, Wix, and more.</span><span> The skills are built specifically for common small business workflows, while exclusive promotions make it easier to get started with the tools you already use. These workflows, promos, and partner webinars, will ensure any owner can integrate with their other tools and utilize agents to finish work with accuracy and efficiency.</span></li>\n     </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 max-w-none not-first:mt-6\">\n     <p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0\"><span>Join us on this journey. Share feedback directly with our product and go-to-market teams through webinar Q&amp;As, conversations at local events, and surveys. We’d love to know what’s working, what's missing, and what you'd like to see next. Your input will help shape our product roadmap, future resources, and the experiences we build for small businesses.</span></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 max-w-none not-first:mt-6\">\n     <p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0\"><span>Sign up to receive updates and opportunities to participate. </span><a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 relative underline-offset-[0.25rem] decoration-1 underline\" href=\"https://openai.com/leads/small-business/\"><span>Fill out this form</span></a><span> to get the latest updates right in your inbox.</span></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 max-w-none not-first:mt-16\">\n     <div class=\"w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px] toc-content-heading scroll-mt-[calc(var(--page-top-space,var(--header-h))+var(--toc-button-h))]\" id=\"how-small-businesses-can-achieve-big-ambitions-with-chatgpt-work\">\n      <div class=\"full-grid-content:@md:col-span-full full-grid-content:@md:col-start-1 max-w-none col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2\">\n       <h2 class=\"text-h3 scroll-mt-[calc(var(--page-top-space,var(--header-h))+var(--toc-button-h))]\"><span>How small businesses can achieve big ambitions with ChatGPT Work</span></h2>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 max-w-none not-first:mt-6\">\n     <p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0\"><span>We recently announced </span><a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 relative underline-offset-[0.25rem] decoration-1 underline\" href=\"https://openai.com/index/chatgpt-for-your-most-ambitious-work/\"><span>ChatGPT Work</span></a><span>, an agent that can complete multi-step tasks and help finish complex projects or initiatives end-to-end. When ChatGPT Work is connected to various parts of your business—your files, applications, and has memory on how you think, write, and work, the possibilities are endless.</span></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-full group not-first:mt-6 py-8\">\n     <section class=\"w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px]\">\n      <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-1\">\n       <div>\n        <div class=\"border-primary-12 bg-secondary-100 dark:border-primary-4 dark:bg-tertiary-100 relative rounded-md border shadow-[0_18px_60px_rgb(0_0_0/0.08)]\">\n         <div class=\"px-6 pb-8 pt-8\">\n          <div class=\"absolute inset-e-6 z-2 flex justify-end top-12\">\n           <div class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3\">\n            <span class=\"text-meta text-primary-60\">1 of 3</span>\n            <div class=\"flex\">\n             <button type=\"button\" class=\"ease-curve-a disabled:text-gray-40 flex items-center justify-center outline-offset-2 transition duration-200 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-0 size-8 focus:outline-primary-44 text-btn-media-label rounded-sm\" disabled aria-label=\"Previous testimonial\">\n              <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 16\">\n               <path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M.246 8.593a.84.84 0 0 1 0-1.186l4.193-4.193A.839.839 0 0 1 5.625 4.4L2.863 7.16h8.04a.839.839 0 1 1 0 1.678h-8.04L5.625 11.6a.839.839 0 1 1-1.186 1.186z\"></path>\n              </svg>\n             </button>\n             <button type=\"button\" class=\"ease-curve-a disabled:text-gray-40 flex items-center justify-center outline-offset-2 transition duration-200 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-0 size-8 text-primary-60 focus:outline-primary-44 hover:bg-none hover:[&amp;&gt;svg]:opacity-60 hover:bg-primary-4 -ms-1 rounded-sm active:scale-95\" aria-label=\"Next testimonial\">\n              <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 16\">\n               <path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M11.754 7.407a.84.84 0 0 1 0 1.186l-4.193 4.193A.839.839 0 0 1 6.375 11.6l2.762-2.76h-8.04a.839.839 0 1 1 0-1.678h8.04L6.375 4.4a.839.839 0 1 1 1.186-1.186z\"></path>\n              </svg>\n             </button>\n            </div>\n           </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"no-scrollbar relative scroll-smooth overflow-x-auto overflow-y-hidden overscroll-x-contain\">\n           <div class=\"sticky inset-s-0 top-0 w-full\">\n            <figure aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"row-start-1 gap-5 self-start transition-opacity duration-250 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.23,1,0.32,1)] opacity-100\">\n             <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-5 mb-10\">\n              <span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Marina Petrova\" class=\"ms-2 block size-[4rem] rounded-full bg-cover bg-center bg-no-repeat\" style=\"background-image:url(&quot;https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260721172359_Marina_Petrova_Intentful.png&quot;)\"></span>\n             </div>\n             <blockquote class=\"text-h5 text-primary-100 relative ms-[0.5em] font-medium tracking-tight text-pretty\">\n              <span class=\"absolute inset-s-[-0.5em] top-0\">“</span><span>ChatGPT has been so much more than a way to get work done faster. It has strengthened the way I think—not by telling me what to do, but by helping me unlock ideas I never thought possible. I’m now experimenting with ChatGPT Work, with ambitious goals for breaking the limits of what’s possible when scaling a startup. It’s not only what can be done faster; it’s what can be done that wasn’t imaginable before.</span>”\n             </blockquote>\n             <figcaption class=\"text-meta text-primary-60 ms-[0.5em]\">\n              <span>—Marina Petrova, CEO and Co-Founder, Intentful.ai</span>\n             </figcaption>\n            </figure>\n           </div>\n          </div>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"relative mt-3 overflow-hidden\">\n         <ul class=\"relative flex\" style=\"width:100%\" aria-label=\"Testimonials\">\n          <li class=\"min-w-0 px-1\" style=\"flex:0 0 33.333333333333336%\">\n           <button type=\"button\" aria-current=\"true\" aria-label=\"Show testimonial from Marina Petrova\" class=\"text-caption text-primary-60 focus-visible:outline-primary-44 duration-short ease-curve-a relative flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center bg-transparent p-2 text-center transition-[background-color,color,opacity,transform] focus-visible:z-1 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-2 active:scale-98 w-full rounded-full hover:bg-primary-4 text-primary-100 md:text-primary-60\"><span class=\"text-balance\">Marina Petrova</span></button>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"min-w-0 px-1\" style=\"flex:0 0 33.333333333333336%\">\n           <button type=\"button\" aria-current=\"false\" aria-label=\"Show testimonial from Adam Ruege\" class=\"text-caption text-primary-60 focus-visible:outline-primary-44 duration-short ease-curve-a relative flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center bg-transparent p-2 text-center transition-[background-color,color,opacity,transform] focus-visible:z-1 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-2 active:scale-98 w-full rounded-full hover:bg-primary-4\"><span class=\"text-balance\">Adam Ruege</span></button>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"min-w-0 px-1\" style=\"flex:0 0 33.333333333333336%\">\n           <button type=\"button\" aria-current=\"false\" aria-label=\"Show testimonial from Kevin English\" class=\"text-caption text-primary-60 focus-visible:outline-primary-44 duration-short ease-curve-a relative flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center bg-transparent p-2 text-center transition-[background-color,color,opacity,transform] focus-visible:z-1 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-2 active:scale-98 w-full rounded-full hover:bg-primary-4\"><span class=\"text-balance\">Kevin English</span></button>\n          </li>\n         </ul>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 max-w-none not-first:mt-6\">\n     <p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0\"><span>We’re most excited for small businesses to explore use cases with ChatGPT Work, and let it take on tasks that would have otherwise been outsourced, fallen to the wayside, or handled as one of the many hats an owner has to tackle. Every business works differently whether you’re a design studio, technology startup, or a non-profit, but one thing remains the same—the work needs to get done. Some examples of how busy owners can use ChatGPT Work to:</span></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 max-w-none not-first:mt-6\">\n     <ul class=\"mb-8 marker:text-inherit last:mb-0 in-[:where(ul,ol)]:mt-2 list-disc in-[:where(ul,ol)]:list-[circle] mx-3 ps-4\">\n      <li class=\"mb-2\"><b><span>Be more productive</span></b><span> – send a free-flow voice note to ChatGPT Work and it will translate your ideas into a concise Slack note that you can send to multiple channels in one go.</span></li>\n      <li class=\"mb-2\"><b><span>Stretch your thinking</span></b><span> – start every week with a Site that updates in real time with market mentions, competitor performance, or product trends you’re interested in. And ask ChatGPT Work to evaluate your current inventory and send ideas for new products or marketing campaigns to boost sales.</span></li>\n      <li class=\"mb-2\"><b><span>Improve your services and offerings</span></b><span> – create a project with your locations’ customer reviews and ask ChatGPT Work to help create a training presentation to celebrate wins and find opportunities for improvement.</span></li>\n     </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 max-w-none not-first:mt-6\">\n     <p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0\"><span>Small businesses need the same enterprise-grade technology, but in an accessible and affordable way. ChatGPT Work is also powered by GPT‑5.6, our most advanced model available to businesses of any size and all subscription plans. Which means businesses can use the latest models and our most powerful agents, whether they are at their desk doing their deepest work, or on the go in between shifts. Small businesses can choose the right level of intelligence model for the work at hand, and together, they give lean teams more flexibility to balance quality, speed, and cost.</span></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 max-w-none not-first:mt-6\">\n     <p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0\"><span>ChatGPT Work and GPT‑5.6 is available to small businesses today—and it is only the beginning.</span></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-full group not-first:mt-16 not-last:mb-16 toc-visible:@md:col-span-8 toc-visible:@md:col-start-1 max-w-none\">\n     <div class=\"w-full mx-auto ease-curve-c duration-medium transition-opacity max-w-container-desktop relative min-h-0\">\n      <div class=\"relative min-h-0 w-full\" style=\"aspect-ratio:16/9\">\n       <div class=\"size-full\">\n        <div class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-md image-aspect-center aspect-(--image-aspect-ratio) max-h-full max-w-full bg-surface-loading\" style=\"--image-aspect-ratio:16/9\">\n         <img alt=\"ChatGPT Work interface shown on desktop and mobile, with connected apps visible against an orange gradient background.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"object-cover object-center\" style=\"top:0;color:transparent;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1728px) 1728px, 100vw\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260721172358_image__8_.png 640w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260721172358_image__8_.png 750w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260721172359_image__8_.png 828w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260721172358_image__8_.png 1080w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260721172359_image__8_.png 1200w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260721172358_image__8_.png 1920w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260721172358_image__8_.png 2048w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260721172359_image__8_.png 3840w\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260721172359_image__8_.png\">\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 max-w-none not-first:mt-6\">\n     <p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0\"><span>For more information on the ChatGPT Work for small Businesses program and to register for upcoming virtual or in-person events, please visit our website </span><a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 relative underline-offset-[0.25rem] decoration-1 underline\" href=\"https://openai.com/business/why-openai/small-business/\"><span>here</span></a><span>. You can also </span><a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 relative underline-offset-[0.25rem] decoration-1 underline\" href=\"https://openai.com/leads/small-business/\"><span>sign up</span></a><span> to receive the latest small business updates, events, and resources, delivered right to your inbox.</span></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-full group not-first:mt-16 not-last:mb-16\">\n     <div class=\"w-full\">\n      <div class=\"toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px] relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-primary-4 rounded-md\">\n       <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-1 relative flex flex-col px-4 py-30\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-h2 text-center\"><span>Join the OpenAI small business program</span></h2>\n        <div class=\"pt-3 text-center text-balance\">Get updates on events, practical AI guidance from mentors and peers, and resources to help your business save time and work smarter with ChatGPT.</div>\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center\">\n         <div class=\"flex flex-row flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-5 pt-8\">\n          <a class=\"transition duration-short ease-curve-a rounded-[2.5rem] text-nowrap min-h-8 flex items-center justify-center gap-[0.3em] text-cta focus:outline outline-offset-2 h-[2.5rem] bg-primary-4 text-primary-100 px-5 hover:bg-primary-12 disabled:bg-primary-4 disabled:text-primary-60 focus:bg-primary-12 focus:outline-primary-12\" href=\"https://openai.com/leads/small-business/\">Join now</a>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"w-full\">\n   <div class=\"flex w-auto\">\n    <div class=\"w-full no-scrollbar overflow-x-auto overflow-y-hidden\">\n     <div class=\"flex min-w-224 px-6 pe-6 flex-none\">\n      <div class=\"relative mb-8 ps-6 min-w-[calc(100%/3)] ps-0 last:me-0\"></div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "OpenAI 宣布推出专为小企业设计的 ChatGPT 计划，包括培训、线下学院、指导资源和合作伙伴集成，以帮助企业家利用 AI 提升生产力和发展。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "OpenAI 宣布推出专为小企业设计的 ChatGPT 计划，包括培训、线下学院、指导资源和合作伙伴集成，以帮助企业家利用 AI 提升生产力和发展。",
  "summary": "本文宣布 OpenAI 推出新的 ChatGPT 小企业计划，旨在帮助企业家将 AI 作为业务运营的力倍增器。该计划包括实操虚拟培训研讨会、美国各地的线下 AI 学院、包含客户案例和互动提示的新入门指南，以及与 Dropbox、Shopify 和 Intuit 等工具的精选合作伙伴集成。文章重点介绍了由 GPT-5.6 驱动的 ChatGPT Work，一个能够处理多步骤任务的智能体，其用例包括将语音笔记转换为 Slack 消息、实时市场监控，以及根据客户评价创建培训演示文稿。公告援引了之前活动的数据：78% 的参与者在一天内构建了可用的 AI 工作流程，42% 的人每周节省超过五小时。虽然具有推广性质，但该计划提供了具体的实施细节和小企业采用的实用示例。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "OpenAI 推出专为小企业设计的全面 ChatGPT 计划。",
      "explanation": "该计划通过提供结构化培训、资源和合作伙伴集成，解决小企业主需要身兼多职的挑战，使 AI 更易于访问。"
    },
    {
      "point": "ChatGPT Work 实现复杂业务项目的多步骤任务完成。",
      "explanation": "由 GPT-5.6 提供支持，该智能体可以连接业务文件和应用程序，处理原本需要外包或被忽略的任务。"
    },
    {
      "point": "之前的 AI Jam 活动显示出参与者可衡量的生产力提升。",
      "explanation": "78% 的参与者在一天内构建了可用的 AI 工作流程，42% 的人每周节省超过五小时，证明了小企业的实际价值。"
    }
  ],
  "keyQuotes": [
    "ChatGPT 不仅是更快速完成工作的方式，更是强化我的思考方式——它不是告诉我该做什么，而是帮助我解锁以前从未想过的想法。"
  ],
